# Things met without editing config (not app config changes, recorded here for completeness):
# - Runner: .NET SDKs with major version above 9 are moved out of C:\Program Files\dotnet\sdk for the
#   run (scripts/runner/pin-dotnet-sdk.ps1). The gallery's global.json rolls forward to the newest SDK,
